1
00:00:03,188 --> 00:00:05,231
Open Commerce, Segments.

2
00:00:05,231 --> 00:00:09,932
Each segment shows its rules, and how many customers meet them.

3
00:00:09,932 --> 00:00:11,568
Click Add segment.

4
00:00:12,046 --> 00:00:17,396
Give it a Name, such as Repeat buyers, and a Description that only your staff see.

5
00:00:18,149 --> 00:00:21,348
Fill in the rules the customers have to meet.

6
00:00:21,348 --> 00:00:26,053
Every rule you fill in has to hold, and a rule left blank is ignored.

7
00:00:26,053 --> 00:00:29,189
Haven't ordered in days finds lapsed buyers.

8
00:00:29,189 --> 00:00:32,263
Ordered in the last days finds recent ones.

9
00:00:32,263 --> 00:00:35,839
First ordered in the last days finds new customers.

10
00:00:36,363 --> 00:00:39,909
At least and At most orders find repeat buyers.

11
00:00:39,909 --> 00:00:44,726
Spent at least and Spent at most find your best customers, in your

12
00:00:44,726 --> 00:00:47,202
store's currency, less refunds.

13
00:00:47,202 --> 00:00:50,213
Country is where their last order went.

14
00:00:50,687 --> 00:00:51,707
Click Save.

15
00:00:51,707 --> 00:00:55,847
The segment shows how many customers are in it, and how many of

16
00:00:55,847 --> 00:00:59,087
them accept marketing, and so get its campaigns.

